abstract: >-
  Praxa is a research library for declarative policies: how they are represented,
  matched, decided, and operationalized by language-model methods. It provides a
  typed policy schema, recognition and disposition services, swappable
  operationalizers, and a light evaluation harness so methods can be compared
  without rewriting the policy object.
